Dear friend,this letter was written with miniVIC WRITE, a text editor in the style of WordStar for the miniVIC. The words wrap by themselves at 40 columns; press ^J or F1 to see every command.Try ^KB at the start of a sentence and ^KK at its end: the block shows in inverse. Then ^KC copies it at the cursor and ^KV moves it. ^QF finds a word, ^QA replaces it everywhere.^KS saves, ^KX saves and goes back to the menu.Best regards,the miniVIC